-sm font-medium text-foreground hover:border-emerald-500/30 transition-colors\" href=\"/federal-tax-brackets\">Federal Tax Brackets</a></div></section><section class=\"mb-8 rounded-xl border border-border/50 bg-muted/30 p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-3\">Popular Salary Calculations</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-4\">Quick access to take-home pay estimates for common salary levels.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-emerald-500/20 bg-emerald-500/5 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-foreground hover:border-emerald-500/40 hover:bg-emerald-500/10 transition-colors\" href=\"/salary/50000\">$50,000</a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-emerald-500/20 bg-emerald-500/5 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-foreground hover:border-emerald-500/40 hover:bg-emerald-500/10 transition-colors\" href=\"/salary/75000\">$75,000</a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-emerald-500/20 bg-emerald-500/5 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-foreground hover:border-emerald-500/40 hover:bg-emerald-500/10 transition-colors\" href=\"/salary/100000\">$100,000</a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-emerald-500/20 bg-emerald-500/5 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-foreground hover:border-emerald-500/40 hover:bg-emerald-500/10 transition-colors\" href=\"/salary/150000\">$150,000</a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-emerald-500/20 bg-emerald-500/5 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-foreground hover:border-emerald-500/40 hover:bg-emerald-500/10 transition-colors\" href=\"/salary/200000\">$200,000</a></div></section><section class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-4\">Related Articles</h2><div class=\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><a class=\"group rounded-xl border border-border/50 bg-card p-5 hover:border-emerald-500/30 hov