ICA optimization, payroll tax strategy, and multi-state tax planning. Rachel holds an MS in Taxation from Golden Gate University and a BS in Accounting from the University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign. She is an active member of the American Institute of Certified Public Accountants (AICPA) and the Illinois CPA Society. Before joining TheTaxCalc, Rachel spent 8 years at a Big Four accounting firm advising high-net-worth clients on tax-efficient wealth strategies.\",\"knowsAbout\":[\"Federal Income Tax\",\"State Income Tax\",\"FICA Tax\",\"Payroll Tax\",\"IRS Compliance\",\"Tax Planning\",\"Multi-State Taxation\",\"Tax-Advantaged Accounts\"],\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/rachelmitchellcpa/\",\"https://www.aicpa-cima.com/\"],\"worksFor\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"TheTaxCalc\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com\"},\"image\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/author-rachel-mitchell.webp\"},{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/california-tax-guide-2026#article\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"California Tax Guide 2026: Income Tax, Sales Tax, and Local Rates\",\"description\":\"Complete guide to California taxes in 2026. Income tax rates, sales tax rates, district taxes, and total tax amount.\",\"image\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/opengraph-image.png\",\"width\":1200,\"height\":630},\"datePublished\":\"2026-06-19T12:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-06-19T12:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/california-tax-guide-2026#author\"},\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/#organization\"},\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/california-tax-guide-2026\"},\"keywords\":[\"california tax calculator\",\"tax amount in california\",\"sales tax rate\",\"local sales tax\",\"income tax rate\",\"district taxes\"],\"wordCount\":2033,\"articleSection\":\"State Tax\"},{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/california-tax-guide-2026#breadcrumb\",\"@type\":